ardella, vicina instabile e segretamente innamorata di Gennaro, decide sedurlo e di rovinargli la festa. Il pretesto glielo offre il decesso improvviso del padre che vive con lei un piano sotto ai Parascandolo. Gennaro, uomo di principi, non ha cuore di celebrare davanti al lutto di Lucia. Ma figlia e consorte non sentono ragione, figuriamoci dovere. Tocca a Gennaro trovare una soluzione e trovarla in fretta."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Mirea is about to be 18 years old, and her family is prepearing a big party for her. Teresa, Mirea's mother, wants to gain notoriety, so begins to spend recklessy for the celebration. When the day finally comes, an unexpected death puts it at risk."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ffwtIElL7oZgNob5Qgw95pAKUP8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ffwtIElL7oZgNob5Qgw95pAKUP8.png","language":"it","width":1274,"height":406}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hvwRHzH0DBeIQlABzlJDFkUKrkN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hvwRHzH0DBeIQlABzlJDFkUKrkN.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmeYyreLC6jb3a2czCxuciU1VAf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bmeYyreLC6jb3a2czCxuciU1VAf.jpg","language":"it","width":1460,"height":2190},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4qsgCkEVfWE29VdWry8TqXXT2xb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4qsgCkEVfWE29VdWry8TqXXT2xb.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96Wz1wHJDCm2hUmbum4FmEF94Mq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/96Wz1wHJDCm2hUmbum4FmEF94Mq.jpg","language":"it","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9yHcbPbpeMlxUyUnIVPGLl95mFi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9yHcbPbpeMlxUyUnIVPGLl95mFi.jpg","langu